From: Ann Cheng <ann.cheng@arm.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2025 14:19:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] meta-evb: meta-evb-arm: Add Send Platform Error Record
 support to SBMR IPMI

Send Platform Error Record (NetFn 2Ch, Command 01h)
This command is used to send the RAS CPER error record to the BMC.
Request Data field
----------------------------------
1     Group extension defining body (AEh)
2...n CPER Error record (Section Descriptor and Section)
----------------------------------------------------
Please see Appendix C.1.2 RAS IPMI message format, SBMR 2.1

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Ann Cheng <Ann.Cheng@arm.com>
Change-Id: I517ff7b520b7a08aff819c7dcb4fa3413cc3d4c9
